sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Manager
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as Flask API
    participant DB as Database
    participant ML as ML Models
    M->>UI: Enter item, date, weather, footfall, planned quantity
    UI->>API: POST /api/predict (JSON)
    API->>API: Validate input
    API->>DB: Read last 7 days of sales for the item
    DB-->>API: Sold and wasted quantities
    API->>ML: Feature vector
    ML-->>API: Predicted waste and predicted demand
    API->>API: Compute recommended quantity and risk level
    API->>DB: Store prediction
    API-->>UI: JSON result
    UI-->>M: Show waste, risk and recommended quantity
